{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791599977,"nonce":"u8hkdYjRhjYBwfmZ8mhp/TU5tEY=","message":"Phase 2 behind -D ashui_native_css: ashui 50399ba, blinc_abi ff7557a and b652b68.\n\n**Parity**\n- All eight test suites and the render pixel test pass under both engines.\n- 30 snapshot scenes, 53 images, are pixel-identical: the galleries (components, forms, data, typography, charts, images), controls, CSS cards, prose, text, shapes, gradients, filters, glass, clip paths, overlays, notches, notch glass and inset shadows, shadow edges, micro, demo.\n- Motion scenes (dialog, forms, menubar, command, tree, toast, sidebar, calendar): every transition that draws frames is the same, with the same start, values and end. Native adds zero-length transitions on two elements in FormMotion: started and interrupted in the same instant, so they draw nothing. An intermediate state is applied within one frame. To look into.\n\n**Found while getting there**\n- The native tree is one for the process: a forest restyle covers every Haxe LayoutTree, so identities are found across trees.\n- Identity.anonymous now tells its hooks when set.\n- A state set before the first frame, such as checked, is read when a selector first tests it, and the restyle runs again in the same flush.\n- Css.markAgain, as an animation ending, applies again though the engine saw no change.\n\n**Cost**\ntests/fixtures/bench/CssBench.hx: 1,621 elements of the components sheet. Median of 9 rounds, three runs each, Ash release build.\n\n| | Haxe | native |\n|---|---|---|\n| sheets in force, first element | 103-117 ms | 94-97 ms |\n| build and style the page | 467-495 ms | 315-336 ms |\n| toggle a class on 10% of rows | 85-91 ms | 1.4-1.5 ms |\n| 40 hover moves, each flushed | 13.2-14.3 ms | 11.4-12.0 ms |\n\nNative mode still builds the Haxe index and parses sheets twice, at compile time and at run time from source.\n\n**Next**\n- Css.select through the native matcher.\n- Native the default, and the Haxe index, matcher and cascade deleted.\n- Then phases 3 and 4.","files":null}]}